    "text": "Let <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math> and <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> denotes the lines<br /><math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></math> and <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#956;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#956;</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></math><br />respectively. If <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></math> is a line which is perpendicular to both <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math> and <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> and cuts both of them, then which of the following options describe(s) <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></math> ?"
