  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>:</mo><mover><mi>r</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi></math></p><p>Let a general point on line&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#955;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Also&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>:</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#956;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;<br />let a general point on line <math><msub><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math>&nbsp;be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>&#956;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Then&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#955;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>&#160;</mi><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#955;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math><br />Now, <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math> is perpendicular to both&nbsp;<math><msub><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math> and <math><msub><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math><br />Hence, <math><mo>(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>)</mo></math> <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#8901;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> (&nbsp;If&nbsp;<math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math> and <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math> are perpendicular then <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#8901;</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> )<br />&amp;&nbsp;<math><mo>(</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>)</mo></math> <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#8901;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Using&nbsp;<br /><math><mo>(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>)</mo></math> <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#8901;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>j</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#955;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#955;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mn>9</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mfenced></math><br />From&nbsp;<math><mo>(</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>)</mo></math>&nbsp;we have&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#8901;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#955;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#955;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>9</mn><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mfenced><mi>ii</mi></mfenced></math><br />Using value of <math><mi>&#955;</mi><mtext>&#8201;</mtext></math> and <math><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>A</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mtext>&#8201;</mtext></math> and <math><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mi>B</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Now, using point <math><mi>A</mi></math> and <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math><br />Equation of line <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>8</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>&#947;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Option <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>)</mo></math> :<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>r</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>t</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mi>t</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>R</mi></math><br />Using point <math><mi>B</mi></math> and <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math><br />Option <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>)</mo></math> :<br />Equation of line <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>r</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>t</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi></math><br />Using midpoint of <math><mi>A</mi></math> and <math><mi>B</mi></math> , <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Option <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>)</mo></math> :<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>r</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>t</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mi>t</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi></math></p>"
  }
}